{"id":"ej9sc8h42rs6flpwle54waldw","title":"中国扫地机厂商集体出海：利润与挑战并存","originalTitle":"扫地机龙头，集体出海“找利润”","summary":"2026年上半年国内扫地机零售量同比下滑4.6%，头部企业科沃斯、石头科技海外收入占比超50%。美国FCC将部分高端扫地机列入受控清单，欧盟拟对割草机加征45.6%-53.3%反倾销税。石头科技通过线下渠道布局实现利润逆势增长41.23%，追觅依赖营销扩张但费用激增5亿元，小米、大疆等跨界厂商凭借生态链优势出海更顺畅。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15348316.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T01:03:38.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T01:20:21.957Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T01:20:21.957Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告","政策发布"],"score":59,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(青橙财经)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}